    "已开启代理：如果无法安装，请为 %@ 添加直连（DIRECT）规则。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Proxy detected: if installation fails, add a DIRECT rule for %@."
